  "CharacterDescription": "Greydon Goodbrother is the eldest son and heir of Gorold Goodbrother Lord of Hammerhorn. He is young, in his early twenties, having grown up understanding that he inherits an Iron Islands lordship which means inheriting a particular worldview: strength is everything, the sea is God, and things taken by iron are more honorably held than things bought or grown. He is being shaped by his father's example and by the Iron Islands culture that surrounds him. He is not yet his own man entirely - still learning what kind of lord he will be.",
